DECISION
--------
Donchian entry 240 / exit 120 / size 4 ETH (high/low channels).
Size 5 earns more in-sample but drawdown and slippage exposure grow
faster than PnL and it leans harder on the single selloff; size 4 is
the robust middle of a flat plateau (240-300 / 120-150 equivalent).
Few trades = cost-model uncertainty barely matters: total modelled
costs are only $48.17 of the +$315.12 gross.

